    "body": "<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-requirements\">\n<p>You must have access to your Meta Business Manager and WhatsApp Business Account (WABA).</p>\n</div>\n<p>Understand how WhatsApp display names work, where they appear, and when they become visible to customers.</p>\n<p>Display names replace your phone number with your business name, helping customers recognize and trust your messages.</p>\n<p>Your display name is reviewed and approved by Meta, not Klaviyo.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHG61Y36HRTQT611Q0\">What is a WhatsApp display name?</h2>\n<p>Your WhatsApp display name is the business name customers see when you message them.</p>\n<p>Instead of showing a phone number, WhatsApp displays this approved name in chats and notifications. This improves recognition and credibility for your business.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>Display names are managed in Meta, not in Klaviyo. Meta reviews and approves all display names.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHF1GDYXF08HNN64AS\">Where your display name appears</h2>\n<p>When a customer receives a message from your WhatsApp number, your display name appears in:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Chat list: the main inbox view where all conversations are listed</li>\n<li>Conversation header: the top of an individual chat thread</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If your display name is not active yet, customers will see your phone number instead.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHQ6TDC58H3HN4PSHR\">When your display name becomes visible</h2>\n<p>Your display name does not appear automatically after setup. Meta controls when it becomes visible.</p>\n<p>Your display name shows only after both of the following are complete:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Your display name is approved by Meta.</li>\n<li>Your account meets at least one eligibility requirement.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Your account must meet one of these thresholds:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your Meta Business Portfolio is verified</li>\n<li>Your phone number reaches a daily messaging limit of at least <strong>2,000 business-initiated conversations</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Until these conditions are met, your phone number appears instead of your display name.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHE8HDD5S5XZDCX6DE\">Where to manage your display name</h2>\n<p>You can <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/48363561261467\">edit your display name in Klaviyo or Meta</a>; however, Meta is always the one to approve any changes. Approvals may take a few days. </p>\n<p>To change your display name, navigate to your WhatsApp settings and click <strong>View</strong> for a phone number. </p>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-none\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/6ct6b26e/help-center-prod/22fc2411707732cfcdffb60de30adaca9c4f5b9e-1284x232.png\" alt=\"Phone number view option\" width=\"full\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHYRT9HKMD3WBRADEV\">Good to know</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Display names are set per phone number</li>\n<li>Each WhatsApp number has its own display name</li>\n<li>Meta reviews and approves all display names</li>\n<li>Any changes require re-approval before they take effect</li>\n<li>You can update your display name up to 10 times within a 30-day period</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFH5D33C3M273W6JA6X\">FAQs</h2>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHVV2DZB6C95VEJ9HP\">My display name is approved, but customers still see my phone number</h3>\n<p>Your account likely has not met the visibility requirements yet.</p>\n<p>To resolve this, make sure you have:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A verified Meta Business Portfolio, or</li>\n<li>Reached at least <strong>2,000 daily business-initiated conversations</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHZQBWF19DGW9SJXW7\">Who controls display name approval?</h3>\n<p>Meta controls all display name reviews and approvals. Klaviyo does not influence this process.</p>\n<h3 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHXA8S2VQTS9SRP2AS\">Do I need to reapply if I change my display name?</h3>\n<p>Yes. Any update requires a new Meta review before it becomes visible.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01KMQX6DFHE0JQWKY1WQP0YEJQ\">Next steps</h2>\n<p>Now that you understand display names:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Set up and edit your display name.</li>\n<li>Follow display name guidelines to avoid rejection.</li>\n<li>Work toward eligibility requirements to make your display name visible.</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-none\"><img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/6ct6b26e/help-center-prod/22fc2411707732cfcdffb60de30adaca9c4f5b9e-1284x232.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"full\"></p>",
